ShopAgent Price Monitor

This repository contains the price-monitoring application extracted from the
maintainer's ShopAgent research project. It is an independent application,
not an official ShopSimulator implementation.

The demo product catalog is fictional and authored for this application.
No third-party product dataset, model weights, private experiment reports,
local credentials, user database, or prior Git history is distributed here.

Python dependencies retain their own licenses. Provider names describe API
compatibility and do not imply affiliation or endorsement.
